# Note: keystore/debug.keystore IS intentionally tracked. It uses the standard Android
# debug credentials (store/key password "android", alias "androiddebugkey"), which are
# public by convention and are not a secret. Tracking it keeps debug builds reproducible
# on machines where the home directory is not writable.
